'''Gurdy Jr.''' is a [[boss]] that can appear in all environments of [[Chapter 2]] ({{s|Caves}}, {{s|Catacombs}}, {{s|Flooded Caves}}).

== Behavior ==
=== Phase 1 ===
* Spawns a {{e|Pooter}}.
* Jumps and shoots a radial of 8 tears in all directions on landing.
* Charges towards Isaac at high speeds, sliding while bouncing off obstacles and walls, She gradually loses speed before coming to a full stop.
** Any Pooters caught in her charge will be killed.
** The course of her charge can be affected by Tear knockback
** If Gurdy Jr. charges into an active bomb, she is slowed down tremendously.

=== Phase 2 ===
* When she has less than 50% health, she uses her charge attack continuously.

== Champion Versions {{unlockable}} ==
: {{bc|7}}: Instead of one Gurdy Jr., there will be two 42% smaller ones. This version has 45% less HP than the original (137.5) and only uses the charging attack. It drops a {{e|Soul Heart}} upon death.
: {{bc|12}}: 15% larger than the regular, with 25% more HP (312.5). She spawns {{e|Super Pooter}}s instead of regular Pooters. Does not shoot projectiles of any sort.

